<title>JAPAN: Rikei - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Rikei - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 14.22		vs	   10.75</p>
<p> Operating    loss 88    million	  vs   loss 190    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 69    million	  vs   loss 173    million</p>
<p> Net		 prft 33 million	  vs   loss 172    million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 2.37 yen	  vs    loss 18.01 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Rikei Corp is a technological trading firm specialising in electronics.</p>
